  Collab handoff + Lane scope: the lane file lives in the vitana-platform plan PR #4232, not yet on vitana-platform main.
  Lane scope's open-plan-PR lookup (ghPlanLaneFetcher) searches 'plan(claude-md-cleanup) in:title', which GitHub search
  returns empty for (checked: gh pr list --search "plan(claude-md-cleanup) in:title" -> []; "claude-md-cleanup in:title" -> #4232).
  Both checks resolve once the plan PR merges. collaboration.md §7b lists "lane file not found because the spec is not on main yet"
  as a known false positive. The plan's executor: claude on a protected-gate lane is the owner exception (plan Decision 2).
